'''Bamboo Island''' (バンブー島 ''Banbū Shima'', '''Bamboo Island''') is the 8th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Not too hard for the most part, but can get somewhat difficult in a few stages. Beware of [[Master A.]] and [[Otta-smack-u]]. Having [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] will help a lot. The hardest stage is arguably [[Disgusting Swamp]], which introduces [[Shadow Boxer K]].
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Shadow Boxer K]]: A very powerful [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy. Has [[Area Attack]]s, high health and attack power, attacks non-stop and moves quite fast. However, she has short range and gets knocked back a lot.
*[[Rain D.]]: A fast-moving enemy with high health and mid-ranged, hard-hitting Area Attacks. Gets knocked back a ridiculous number of times, and often appears as support or protection for other strong enemies.

